msgstr "上述表格的简单型、网格型、列表型标记如下::"

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:319
msgid ""
"================== ============\n"
"Purpose            Table type\n"
"================== ============\n"
"listing shortcuts  Simple table\n"
"lots of colspans   Grid table\n"
